{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/1441517-trinity-continuum-max-mercer-theory","id":1441517,"title":"[Trinity Continuum] Max Mercer Theory","path":["Home","Onyx Path","Onyx Path Worlds","The Trinity Continuum"],"posts":[{"date":"2021-03-26T09:41:13-07:00","id":1441517,"title":"[Trinity Continuum] Max Mercer Theory","content":"EDIT: Okay, <b>Appendix: Setting Secrets </b>chapter of <b>TC: Adventure! 2E </b>has very nice summary what is, <i>what was and how it can go with Mercer. If you really need enter his 'theory' field - just read this part of the book. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/wink.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Wink\" smilieid=\"4\" class=\"inlineimg\" /> </i>And return here to expand with us more, into the Mercer rabbit hole. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/cool.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Cool\" smilieid=\"6\" class=\"inlineimg\" /> <hr /><br /> I marked <b>Trinity Continuum</b> as I ask about 'canon' of 2E <b>Trinity</b> settings - <b>Adventure!</b>, <b>Modern</b>, <b>Aberrant</b> and <b>Aeon</b> timeline. NOT 1E interpretation...<br /> <br /> So question - <b>Is Max Mercer time traveler?</b> I seen some rumors about it on forums.<br /> <br /> <b>If he <u>is</u> traveler - from what era times he started time hopping?</b> Was it <b>Adventure!</b>, <b>Modern</b>, <b>Aberrant</b> or <b>Aeon</b> era?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1437,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","user":"wyrdhamster","date":". 04-20-2021, 06:18 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-03-26T09:59:18-07:00","id":1441520,"title":"","content":"Max Mercer hasn't yet been revealed in TC, other than a handful of mentions; but he's going to appear in TC:Adventure, which is where he got his start; and barring a drastic change from the Trinity Universe setting, he's a time traveler \u2014 but more of an \u201cunstuck in time\u201d traveler, in that he doesn't appear to have much control over it. Mostly, he's depicted as staying in one time for about a decade or so, then leaving for another era for a similarly long stay. His arrivals tend to be pegged to large \u201cexotic energy events\u201d such as the ones that triggered the Adventure, Aberrant, and \u00c6on eras, meaning that he's likely to be present in all three of them.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div style=\"margin-left:40px\"> <div align=\"center\">My hacks: <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwtrin\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#0000FF\">Trinity Continuum</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwscion\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#008000\">Scion</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwExalt\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#DAA520\">Exalted</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwcwod\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#800000\">World of Darkness</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwnwod\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#FF0000\">Chronicles of Darkness</span></a></div> </div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/421-dataweaver","name":"Dataweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar421_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"8420"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-03-26T10:15:30-07:00","id":1441522,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> Of course, Max Mercer has had the ad- vantage of considerable foresight, not just because he\u2019s a visionary futurist with great faith in human- ity, but also because he is one of the world\u2019s most potent Talents, and a time-traveler. </div> </div> </div>TC: Aberrant, Page 276<br /> <br /> The rest is as described by Dataweaver","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481584/house-rules-bundle-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">House Rules - The Bundle</a> - House Rules for Everyone<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481581/powered-inspiration-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">Powered Inspired</a> - Powered Characters using Inspiration and Gifts<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/413362/Fists-and-Tomes-BUNDLE\" target=\"_blank\">Fists and Tomes</a> - Inspired Martial Arts and Mysticism for Talents<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/492147/supertech\" target=\"_blank\">Supertech</a> - Super Science in the hands of Talents","edited":{"userid":24985,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24985-mateus-luz","user":"Mateus Luz","date":". 03-26-2021, 01:18 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24985-mateus-luz","name":"Mateus Luz","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24985_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2950"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-03-26T10:25:14-07:00","id":1441524,"title":"","content":"\u00c6on, page 357: &quot;the mysterious Max Mercer became an exceptionally powerful Talent who possessed a limited ability to travel through time&quot;<br /> <br /> Aberrant, page 276 as noted by Mateus<br /> <br /> tl;dr: yes he's a time traveler","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b><span style=\"color:#800000\">Ian A. A. Watson</span></b><span style=\"color:#bdc3c7\">(he/she)</span><br /> <b>Onyx Path Community Manager<br /> Trinity Continuum Content Lead</b>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4-ianwatson","name":"IanWatson","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4_2.png","title":"Community Manager","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1512"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-03-26T14:12:49-07:00","id":1441553,"title":"","content":"The Continuum resolves a lot of moral questions about Mercer\u2019s time travel, since it appears to just create divergent timelines in the infinity of the continuum rather than writing over the previous timeline - so any question of \u201cwell why didn\u2019t he do x\u201d can easily be resolved by \u201cmaybe he did, but that\u2019s not the timeline you\u2019re in.\u201d","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Check out my expansion to the <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/185084-autochthonia-house-material\" target=\"_blank\">Realm of Brass and Shadow</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1098-glamourweaver","name":"glamourweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1098_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"7541"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-03-27T01:52:16-07:00","id":1441617,"title":"","content":"So there is no canonical start of Mercers life? Like, his first 'life' was in 1900-1930's - then he jumped to 2010's - and then Aeon Era of 2100's? Because if this is canon - Mercer could not return to 1930s with knowledge of 'progressive future' of 2010's. OR he jumped in Hammersmith Incident moment ( surviving fire), lives few years in 2000s, return to seconds after Hammersmith Incident - and THEN he build Aeon Society as force for progress... \ud83e\udd14","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1437,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","user":"wyrdhamster","date":". 11-24-2021, 09:50 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-03-27T02:03:30-07:00","id":1441618,"title":"","content":"No. He started his lad somewhere in the 1890s, his power kicked him from the 1920s to the 1940s, where his older self teach him some stuff, he comeback to the 20s and funded the Aeon Society. All the things he did to the timeline are covered, and maybe just a few know what he did (never openly stated). We know he visited many ages, and he is alive in Aeon era, but not sure if he jumped to future and back or just lived all the way to that period.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481584/house-rules-bundle-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">House Rules - The Bundle</a> - House Rules for Everyone<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481581/powered-inspiration-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">Powered Inspired</a> - Powered Characters using Inspiration and Gifts<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/413362/Fists-and-Tomes-BUNDLE\" target=\"_blank\">Fists and Tomes</a> - Inspired Martial Arts and Mysticism for Talents<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/492147/supertech\" target=\"_blank\">Supertech</a> - Super Science in the hands of Talents","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24985-mateus-luz","name":"Mateus Luz","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24985_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2950"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-03-27T02:05:18-07:00","id":1441619,"title":"","content":"Wyrd, I don\u2019t think you\u2019re going to get much more from this line of questioning. <br /> <br /> If there\u2019s an answer, it\u2019s likely to be in the Setting Secrets chapter of Adventure! Which as you know is currently in its Kickstarter campaign. Which means that anyone who knows the answer isn\u2019t going to tell you because they don\u2019t want to spoil the reveal in that section of the manuscript preview, and anyone who doesn\u2019t know the answer has nothing to say until that part of the manuscript preview drops. <br /> <br /> I didn\u2019t work on Adventure! I don\u2019t know what the answer to your question is. But I imagine I\u2019ll learn more by the end of the KS campaign.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>Writer. Developer.</i> <b>World of Darkness</b> | <b>Chronicles of Darkness</b> | <b>The Trinity Continuum</b>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/156-bunyip","name":"Bunyip","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar156_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1880"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-03-27T02:57:48-07:00","id":1441622,"title":"","content":"Expanding on Bunyip, as we don\u2019t have all the Adventure book to read, if you have the Aeon and Aberrant books, my suggestion is, go to the timeline chapter of each and got to the setting secrets chapter. The first will tell you how things are and how they get there, and the last will talk a little about the behind the scene and the major players. Extremely useful!","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481584/house-rules-bundle-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">House Rules - The Bundle</a> - House Rules for Everyone<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481581/powered-inspiration-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">Powered Inspired</a> - Powered Characters using Inspiration and Gifts<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/413362/Fists-and-Tomes-BUNDLE\" target=\"_blank\">Fists and Tomes</a> - Inspired Martial Arts and Mysticism for Talents<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/492147/supertech\" target=\"_blank\">Supertech</a> - Super Science in the hands of Talents","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24985-mateus-luz","name":"Mateus Luz","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24985_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2950"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-03-27T02:58:40-07:00","id":1441623,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Bunyip</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/1441517-trinity-continuum-max-mercer-theory?p=1441619#post1441619\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I didn\u2019t work on Adventure! I don\u2019t know what the answer to your question is. But I imagine I\u2019ll learn more by the end of the KS campaign.</div> </div> </div> </div>We will see if Marcer's timeline will be unveiled in Adventure! KS preview. But still...<br /> <br /> \u200b<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Mateus Luz</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/1441517-trinity-continuum-max-mercer-theory?p=1441618#post1441618\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">He started his lad somewhere in the 1890s, his power kicked him from the 1920s to the 1940s, where his older self teach him some stuff, he comeback to the 20s and funded the Aeon Society.</div> </div> </div> </div>...is nice sum-up what I needed for running Mercer for the time being. So, <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24985-mateus-luz\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar24985_3.png');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"24985\" data-vbnamecard=\"24985\">Mateus Luz</a>, you put your bets on that Mercer was born in circles 1860s, had some adventures in 1900-1910s, then Hammersmith Accident, he was pulled from 1920s - jump to 2010s for few years - and then return to 1920, yes? With advent that he meet his older version of himself in 2010s?<br /> <br /> Do I miss something, or does it sound that Mercer is <i>virtually</i> immortal, if he has something like 160 years in 2010 year and his older self still lives there?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1437,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","user":"wyrdhamster","date":". 11-24-2021, 09:51 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-03-27T07:06:25-07:00","id":1441637,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>wyrdhamster</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/1441517-trinity-continuum-max-mercer-theory?p=1441623#post1441623\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">So, <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24985-mateus-luz\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar24985_3.png');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"24985\" data-vbnamecard=\"24985\">Mateus Luz</a>, you put your bets on that Mercer was born in circles 1860s, had some adventures in 1900-1910s, then Hammersmith Accident, he was pulled from 1920s - jump to 2010s for few years - and then return to 1920, yes? With advent that he meet his older version of himself in 2010s?<br /> <br /> Do I miss something, or does it sound that Mercer is <i>virtually</i> immortal, if he has something like 160 years in 2010 year and his older self still lives there?</div> </div> </div> </div>He was born in the 1890s, he was young (30s, I am 38 and I feel young) when Hammersmith happened. He was rich and had some travels for sure, he knew real explorers, and he had been on adventurous places.<br /> <br /> In 1e, Mercer is launched to 1940s where he met himself and part of the Aeon Society, and get a quick class about time travel from the older himself. Than he return to 1920s to create the society. That\u2019s 1e stuff, maybe didn\u2019t happen in TC.<br /> <br /> When does he start time traveling around? No idea.<br /> When have he been? No idea.<br /> What ave he done in those periods? Probably something related to Aeon Society, other than that no idea.<br /> <br /> We know he talks to her granddaughter in 2020s, we know he have been in the end of Aberrant War (or at least watched the results and the final speach from Mal (and returned to the 1940s or 1950s to give him some advise in the form of a letter) and we know he had some activity in the 2120s during Aeon era. That\u2019s what we know.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481584/house-rules-bundle-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">House Rules - The Bundle</a> - House Rules for Everyone<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481581/powered-inspiration-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">Powered Inspired</a> - Powered Characters using Inspiration and Gifts<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/413362/Fists-and-Tomes-BUNDLE\" target=\"_blank\">Fists and Tomes</a> - Inspired Martial Arts and Mysticism for Talents<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/492147/supertech\" target=\"_blank\">Supertech</a> - Super Science in the hands of Talents","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24985-mateus-luz","name":"Mateus Luz","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24985_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2950"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-03-27T07:33:28-07:00","id":1441638,"title":"","content":"One thing that we now know is that he disappeared while helping people try and get from the burning mansion. We also know that Donigal ran into the burning building after his friend, which for me is an awww moment. <br /> <br /> Also him meeting and learning from himself who met and learned from himself is one of those headache inducing timey whimey elements that is fantastic to ponder about.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/661-lordheru","name":"LordHeru","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar661_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1100"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-03-27T13:45:29-07:00","id":1441688,"title":"","content":"So, a side topic, but related - Sara Kaur - she is described as 'rival' Mesmerist to Mercer. And from what I seen on forum - she is immortal. What are her names across time?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-03-27T16:38:11-07:00","id":1441727,"title":"","content":"She is not Max rival, she is a equivalent, like Primoris is the equivalent Stalwart of Max. She became the Quantakinesis Proxy in 2108 and was possessed by a Doyen for about 8 years, until she fake her death when her order was purged.<br /> <br /> Sara Kaur in the 1930s<br /> Krona Bush in the 2020s<br /> S. K. Bhurano in the 2120s","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481584/house-rules-bundle-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">House Rules - The Bundle</a> - House Rules for Everyone<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481581/powered-inspiration-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">Powered Inspired</a> - Powered Characters using Inspiration and Gifts<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/413362/Fists-and-Tomes-BUNDLE\" target=\"_blank\">Fists and Tomes</a> - Inspired Martial Arts and Mysticism for Talents<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/492147/supertech\" target=\"_blank\">Supertech</a> - Super Science in the hands of Talents","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24985-mateus-luz","name":"Mateus Luz","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24985_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2950"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-04-13T11:53:32-07:00","id":1443775,"title":"","content":"<b><a href=\"http://theonyxpath.com/covering-the-pulp-genre-with-tc-adventure-monday-meeting-notes/\" target=\"_blank\">Max Mercer from Adventure! cover</a></b> - punching skeleton! \u2764\ufe0f<br /> <br /> <img src=\"http://theonyxpath.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/04/Adventure_02.jpg\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1437,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","user":"wyrdhamster","date":". 04-13-2021, 03:01 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-04-18T18:42:00-07:00","id":1444583,"title":"","content":"Or Max is seeing what a mess was made in 1E and is trying to correct things with 2nd E <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/biggrin.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Big Grin\" smilieid=\"3\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13091-thewanderingjewels","name":"TheWanderingJewels","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar13091_1.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"112"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-04-19T21:59:51-07:00","id":1444778,"title":"","content":"I REALLY need this <a href=\"https://www.kickstarter.com/projects/200664283/trinity-continuum-adventure-tabletop-roleplaying-game/\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Adventure!</b> Kickstarter</a> stretch goal to really wrap my head around all the Max Mercer conundrums! Two days only, guys, to get it!<br /> <br /> <i><b>Exploring Alternate Timelines! </b>\u2013 Discussion and guidance on the timelines created by Max Mercer each time he tried to change the future and how to play in some of them will be added to the <b>Trinity Continuum: Adventure! Companion </b>PDF.</i>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1437,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","user":"wyrdhamster","date":". 04-20-2021, 05:58 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-04-20T08:18:35-07:00","id":1444829,"title":"","content":"One of the things I find interesting is that reality allows for small changes to propagate down the line of a timeline while large changes lead to the formation of parallel worlds. It makes me wonder about an order who decides to create their chosen timeline by making a million small changes throughout its history in order to lead to an end result that is miraculous but ultimately of the timeline itself. Issues of morality aside (and I don't really feel like playing that game) this would be a vast and awesome undertaking.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/661-lordheru","name":"LordHeru","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar661_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1100"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-04-20T15:16:45-07:00","id":1444927,"title":"","content":"Okay, <b>Appendix: Setting Secrets </b>chapter of <b>TC: Adventure! 2E </b>has very nice summary what is, what was and how it can go with Mercer. If you really need enter his 'theory' field - just read this part of the book. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/wink.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Wink\" smilieid=\"4\" class=\"inlineimg\" /> And return here to expand with us more, into the Mercer rabbit hole. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/cool.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Cool\" smilieid=\"6\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-04-20T15:31:30-07:00","id":1444931,"title":"","content":"<b>Mercer Ultimate Spoiler!!! </b>( You've been warned )<br /> <br /> So, after Hammersmith Incident in 1922, Maxwell Mercer started to jump inexperiance forward in time - and in coming too 200 years in future - he confronted himself with 'evil', mutated version of himself, cynical and cruel entity, with so much experience that it lost all hope for the universe - and want to destroy humanity! <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/eek.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"EEK!\" smilieid=\"9\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> Greatest time traveler needs to fight himself to save universe! Very <a href=\"https://www.cbr.com/marvel-kang-the-conqueror-facts/\" target=\"_blank\">Marvel's Kang</a>, I must say - and I love it! \u2764\ufe0f<br /> <br /> ( And Mercer is secretly gay, in love with Micheal Donighal, a.k.a. Dr. Primoris! <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/eek.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"EEK!\" smilieid=\"9\" class=\"inlineimg\" /> Love story is beautifully complicated. )","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1437,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","user":"wyrdhamster","date":". 04-20-2021, 06:57 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-04-20T17:52:23-07:00","id":1444973,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>wyrdhamster</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/1441517-trinity-continuum-max-mercer-theory?p=1444931#post1444931\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><b>Mercer Ultimate Spoiler!!! </b>( You've been warned )<br /> <br /> So, after Hammersmith Incident in 1922, Maxwell Mercer started to jump inexperiance forward in time - and in coming too 200 years in future - he confronted himself with 'evil', mutated version of himself, cynical and cruel entity, with so much experience that it lost all hope for the universe - and want to destroy humanity! <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/eek.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"EEK!\" smilieid=\"9\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> Greatest time traveler needs to fight himself to save universe! Very <a href=\"https://&amp;quot;&#91;url\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.cbr.com/marvel-kang-the-conqueror-facts/&amp;quot;]Marvel's</a> Kang[/URL], I must say - and I love it! \u2764\ufe0f<br /> <br /> ( And Mercer is secretly gay, in love with Micheal Donighal, a.k.a. Dr. Primoris! <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/eek.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"EEK!\" smilieid=\"9\" class=\"inlineimg\" /> Love story is beautifully complicated. )</div> </div> </div> </div>He is not necessarily gay, LGBT for sure, probably Ace (Danielle wrote him as Ace). But it becomes a interesting love story, while before he was just out of reach of Primoris (straight), now he chose to avoid the relationship for \u201cnot being able to grant what he needs\u201d.<br /> <br /> Love is a complex feeling, Max could be straight and yet love Michael in a non sexual way, basically the same way as an Ace would do.<br /> <br /> The happy part is Mal finds eventually a person who loves him, worships him actually, but yet, again, love the complex feeling, he never get over max, and end up writing letters to the man he believes is dead.<br /> <br /> It\u2019s much better than Romeo and Juliet...","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481584/house-rules-bundle-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">House Rules - The Bundle</a> - House Rules for Everyone<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481581/powered-inspiration-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">Powered Inspired</a> - Powered Characters using Inspiration and Gifts<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/413362/Fists-and-Tomes-BUNDLE\" target=\"_blank\">Fists and Tomes</a> - Inspired Martial Arts and Mysticism for Talents<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/492147/supertech\" target=\"_blank\">Supertech</a> - Super Science in the hands of Talents","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24985-mateus-luz","name":"Mateus Luz","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24985_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2950"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-04-20T21:17:11-07:00","id":1444988,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Mateus Luz</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/1441517-trinity-continuum-max-mercer-theory?p=1444973#post1444973\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> He is not necessarily gay, LGBT for sure, probably Ace (Danielle wrote him as Ace). But it becomes a interesting love story, while before he was just out of reach of Primoris (straight), now he chose to avoid the relationship for \u201cnot being able to grant what he needs\u201d.</div> </div> </div> </div>Given that Max - who is described in the appendix as &quot;completely uninterested in sex&quot; - has a 'son' named MICHAEL Maxwell Mercer, I do have to wonder if Dr. Primoris - either from the main timeline or an alternate universe - made a test tube baby with his unrequited love's DNA, then sent the kid to live with his other dad while he got back to work elevating a select slice of humanity to godhood. Given that Michael Mercer's personality is described as &quot;far more severe and goal oriented than his father&quot; you could presume that her learned that behavior from his other dad.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25506-shepherdboi","name":"Shepherdboi","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar25506_1.gif","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"364"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-04-20T22:20:26-07:00","id":1444992,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Shepherdboi</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/1441517-trinity-continuum-max-mercer-theory?p=1444988#post1444988\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Given that Max - who is described in the appendix as &quot;completely uninterested in sex&quot; - has a 'son' named MICHAEL Maxwell Mercer, I do have to wonder if Dr. Primoris - either from the main timeline or an alternate universe - made a test tube baby with his unrequited love's DNA, then sent the kid to live with his other dad while he got back to work elevating a select slice of humanity to godhood. Given that Michael Mercer's personality is described as &quot;far more severe and goal oriented than his father&quot; you could presume that her learned that behavior from his other dad.</div> </div> </div> </div>That's certainly a possibility, given Donighal's Mega-Intellect. A theory that I always subscribed to that I'm having to revise now was that Michael was the product of a tryst Max had with a female friend. Now, I'm thinking that Max in his earlier years might have tried out sex to see if he could be &quot;normal&quot; (much like gay and lesbian individuals being in heterosexual relationships to try and fit in) before coming to the realization afterwards that no, that's not who he is.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26317-critian-caceorte","name":"Critian Caceorte","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2020"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"246"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-04-21T07:38:40-07:00","id":1445046,"title":"","content":"Wow... Mayor kudos to the authors for the appendix, so many fascinating secrets, from how time travel works in this universe to Max's complex relationship with Doninghal, I love it all.<br /> <br /> That said the one thing that I'm absolutely captivated with is the hint about Max having a future evil version of himself hunting him. What if the whole continuum is the result of their conflict? Younger Max trying to improve his original timeline with small changes and protect the multiverse while Old Max is trying to create the perfect timeline by destroying all other possibilities? I'm just speculating, but I'm definitely using evil Max in one of my campaigns.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2964-firanai","name":"Firanai","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2964_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"672"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-04-21T08:39:14-07:00","id":1445053,"title":"","content":"I'm honestly not sure about the 'change' in Mercer. I always liked (in a non-liking sort of way) the idea that it was one-sided forbidden love in that Michael loved Max but the later was straight and so couldn't love him back. The idea that Max did love him romantically but not sexually throws the whole Michael doing what he did due to spurred love on its head.<br /> <br /> Which, I guess, thinking about it, does work. It takes away spurned love as a reason for Michael's later actions and makes them more logical then emotional. <br /> <br /> So yeah, not sure about it. <br /> <br /> I will say this - I do not believe that Michael (even in his Doctor Primoris design) was a Nazi. Especially considering him being gay and such. <br /> <br /> Speaking of that him respecting Sara and helping her get out due to understanding prejudice at least in part was AWESOME to see. I seriously wish the two spoke more, put aside what seemed to divide them and became actual day to day friends. <br /> <br /> One final thing Max and Anti-Max was an AWESOME idea. Anti-Max or Evil-Max or even Shadow-Max fighting our true Max is such a great pulp thing that I can't help but love it completely. So yeah good stuff on that.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/661-lordheru","name":"LordHeru","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar661_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1100"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-04-21T09:39:29-07:00","id":1445062,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>LordHeru</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/1441517-trinity-continuum-max-mercer-theory?p=1445053#post1445053\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I'm honestly not sure about the 'change' in Mercer. I always liked (in a non-liking sort of way) the idea that it was one-sided forbidden love in that Michael loved Max but the later was straight and so couldn't love him back. The idea that Max did love him romantically but not sexually throws the whole Michael doing what he did due to spurred love on its head.<br /> <br /> Which, I guess, thinking about it, does work. It takes away spurned love as a reason for Michael's later actions and makes them more logical then emotional.<br /> <br /> So yeah, not sure about it.</div> </div> </div> </div>Michael is still experiencing spurned love. But instead of the (honestly rather unbelievable) trope of a gay man holding onto feelings for a straight man, it is that feeling when a person admits they love you but still refuse to date you because &quot;it's me, not you&quot;. A far more relatable scenario, and one that can and has driven people to terrible ends.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Danielle Lauzon, Requiem Developer, Storypath Guru, freelance writer","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6155-impernious","name":"impernious","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"37"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-04-21T10:32:14-07:00","id":1445072,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>LordHeru</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/1441517-trinity-continuum-max-mercer-theory?p=1445053#post1445053\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">One final thing Max and Anti-Max was an AWESOME idea. Anti-Max or Evil-Max or even Shadow-Max fighting our true Max is such a great pulp thing that I can't help but love it completely. So yeah good stuff on that.</div> </div> </div> </div>I have a smart suggestion to the adversary name, Min Mercer, as opposition to Max Mercer... let it sink a little...","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481584/house-rules-bundle-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">House Rules - The Bundle</a> - House Rules for Everyone<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481581/powered-inspiration-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">Powered Inspired</a> - Powered Characters using Inspiration and Gifts<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/413362/Fists-and-Tomes-BUNDLE\" target=\"_blank\">Fists and Tomes</a> - Inspired Martial Arts and Mysticism for Talents<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/492147/supertech\" target=\"_blank\">Supertech</a> - Super Science in the hands of Talents","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24985-mateus-luz","name":"Mateus Luz","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24985_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2950"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-04-21T12:50:23-07:00","id":1445102,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Mateus Luz</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/1441517-trinity-continuum-max-mercer-theory?p=1445072#post1445072\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I have a smart suggestion to the adversary name, Min Mercer, as opposition to Max Mercer... let it sink a little...</div> </div> </div> </div>That is absolutely terrible...also I'm going to use it and give you a like XD","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2964-firanai","name":"Firanai","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2964_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"672"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-04-21T13:38:20-07:00","id":1445112,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>LordHeru</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/1441517-trinity-continuum-max-mercer-theory?p=1445053#post1445053\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I will say this - I do not believe that Michael (even in his Doctor Primoris design) was a Nazi. Especially considering him being gay and such.</div> </div> </div> </div>Don't forget he's also Irish. It may seem odd in this modern era of massive yearly St. Patrick's Day celebrations, but there was historically a lot of really severe anti-Irish racism. The word Hibernophobia is apparently the technical term:<br /> <br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Anti-Irish_sentiment\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/c/c6/TheUsualIrishWayofDoingThings_%28cr%29.jpg/1280px-TheUsualIrishWayofDoingThings_%28cr%29.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=index&amp;utm_content=thumbnail\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Anti-Irish_sentiment\" target=\"_blank\"> Anti-Irish sentiment - Wikipedia </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Anti-Irish_sentiment\" target=\"_blank\"> https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Anti-Irish_sentiment </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> </div> </div> </div>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25506-shepherdboi","name":"Shepherdboi","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar25506_1.gif","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"364"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-04-21T14:23:04-07:00","id":1445117,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>LordHeru</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/1441517-trinity-continuum-max-mercer-theory?p=1445053#post1445053\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"> I will say this - I do not believe that Michael (even in his Doctor Primoris design) was a Nazi. Especially considering him being gay and such.</div> </div> </div> </div>This threw me off a little, did I miss something in the text? Does it imply anywhere that he's a nazi?<br /> <br /> In any case, I don't believe he's a literal nazi either, but he's a supremacist for sure, and a peculiar one at that. Instead of looking for exclusivity for his &quot;people&quot; he wants to raise everyone else to his level, whether they want it or not.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2964-firanai","name":"Firanai","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2964_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"672"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-04-21T14:40:05-07:00","id":1445125,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Firanai</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/1441517-trinity-continuum-max-mercer-theory?p=1445117#post1445117\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> This threw me off a little, did I miss something in the text? Does it imply anywhere that he's a nazi?<br /> <br /> In any case, I don't believe he's a literal nazi either, but he's a supremacist for sure, and a peculiar one at that. Instead of looking for exclusivity for his &quot;people&quot; he wants to raise everyone else to his level, whether they want it or not.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> Its a sort of throwback to 1e in some ways where there were rumors and hints and suggestions that maybe he joined with them. It took off for a while and so it was on my mind after reading the section. <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/661-lordheru","name":"LordHeru","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar661_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1100"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-04-21T18:36:48-07:00","id":1445172,"title":"","content":"As new 2E <b>Trinity</b> fan, and on open reading text, to me <i><b>Michael Donighal / Dr. Primoris / Divis Mal </b></i>is simply 'Inspired' supremacists. ( Later on, real Nova supremacists, as he 'created' Novas and Aberrants as we see in Aberrant War events. ) Supremacists are not direct Nazis - but all Nazis are particular type of Supremacists. / Or, at least, it's my reading of <b>TC: Adventure!</b> 2E preview material. /","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-04-21T19:14:06-07:00","id":1445181,"title":"","content":"Primoris is not Nazi in any way, and I don\u2019t think he is really Supremacist until much later (somewhere around Aberrant era start). He believes he is a evolved form of people BUT he also believes most (if not everyone) could become a Stalwart. Also he didn\u2019t really acted against the people he believed inferior, he was trying to understand how to make people evolve and how powerful people can be, and how he can help them to have a better lived, not really how to get rid of the inferiors (he gets there sometime before Aberrant War).<br /> <br /> I see him more like a person that feed homeless people because he believes they are incapable of helping themselves, it\u2019s not wrong, but definitely not right too...","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481584/house-rules-bundle-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">House Rules - The Bundle</a> - House Rules for Everyone<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481581/powered-inspiration-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">Powered Inspired</a> - Powered Characters using Inspiration and Gifts<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/413362/Fists-and-Tomes-BUNDLE\" target=\"_blank\">Fists and Tomes</a> - Inspired Martial Arts and Mysticism for Talents<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/492147/supertech\" target=\"_blank\">Supertech</a> - Super Science in the hands of Talents","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24985-mateus-luz","name":"Mateus Luz","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24985_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2950"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-04-21T19:44:48-07:00","id":1445188,"title":"","content":"So does this mean we will see in Assassins Tier 3 paramorphs given its the next book in the timeline where Talents reign supreme and barrier doesn't seem to break?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2715-lian","name":"Lian","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5218"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-04-21T20:40:15-07:00","id":1445208,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Lian</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/1441517-trinity-continuum-max-mercer-theory?p=1445188#post1445188\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">So does this mean we will see in Assassins Tier 3 paramorphs given its the next book in the timeline where Talents reign supreme and barrier doesn't seem to break?</div> </div> </div> </div>No. it was said Assassin is a supplement to Core focused around talents that are particularly violent and kill people, while Core is more about heroism and doing good things.<br /> <br /> Anima is also not where we will see T3 Talents, as it is focused around talents using cybernetics and virtual reality.<br /> <br /> So far, no book in the line has any indicative of having T3 Talents.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481584/house-rules-bundle-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">House Rules - The Bundle</a> - House Rules for Everyone<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481581/powered-inspiration-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">Powered Inspired</a> - Powered Characters using Inspiration and Gifts<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/413362/Fists-and-Tomes-BUNDLE\" target=\"_blank\">Fists and Tomes</a> - Inspired Martial Arts and Mysticism for Talents<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/492147/supertech\" target=\"_blank\">Supertech</a> - Super Science in the hands of Talents","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24985-mateus-luz","name":"Mateus Luz","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24985_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2950"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-04-21T21:58:21-07:00","id":1445220,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Mateus Luz</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/1441517-trinity-continuum-max-mercer-theory?p=1445208#post1445208\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> No. it was said Assassin is a supplement to Core focused around talents that are particularly violent and kill people, while Core is more about heroism and doing good things.<br /> <br /> Anima is also not where we will see T3 Talents, as it is focused around talents using cybernetics and virtual reality.<br /> <br /> So far, no book in the line has any indicative of having T3 Talents.</div> </div> </div> </div>Given the last part of Mercer's write up or the write up where he dies sounds suspiciously like the CORE universe...and given Assassins is the only CORE world going forward that's not part of the Abberrant/Anima/Aeon/etc timeline...and it describes that as the only source for upgraded Talents...<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2715-lian","name":"Lian","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5218"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-04-21T23:48:13-07:00","id":1445232,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Lian</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/1441517-trinity-continuum-max-mercer-theory?p=1445220#post1445220\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Given the last part of Mercer's write up or the write up where he dies sounds suspiciously like the CORE universe...and given Assassins is the only CORE world going forward that's not part of the Abberrant/Anima/Aeon/etc timeline...and it describes that as the only source for upgraded Talents...</div> </div> </div> </div>The major fallacy is assuming Assassins is the only one - it's the only one we know of. We know they have more planned which aren't currently in production, like Aegis, so it's entirely possible a T3 Talents supplement would be one of those.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/51-marin","name":"marin","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2019"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-04-22T03:08:52-07:00","id":1445249,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>marin</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/1441517-trinity-continuum-max-mercer-theory?p=1445232#post1445232\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> The major fallacy is assuming Assassins is the only one - it's the only one we know of. We know they have more planned which aren't currently in production, like Aegis, so it's entirely possible a T3 Talents supplement would be one of those.</div> </div> </div> </div>This is true. Aegis could end up being akin to Assassin's Creed Odyssey where you have some semi-super powers but nothing like Scion level or Aberrant level but somewhat closer to Adventure! levels.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/786-thedonnie","name":"thedonnie","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"567"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-04-22T07:50:45-07:00","id":1445265,"title":"","content":"A lot of assumptions being made here.<br /> <br /> All I have said is that I would like to cover Mercer-level Talents at some point. (Ditto \u00c6gis, which I occasionally must repeat, has not been confirmed as a real product.)<br /> <br /> That does not mean a) it's definitely happening, and b) it's in one of the books which has currently been announced.<br /> <br /> We have ideas we're tossing around. We have books in pre-production which have not yet been announced. There's no guarantee that every book I want to make will get made.<br /> <br /> Please be patient.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b><span style=\"color:#800000\">Ian A. A. Watson</span></b><span style=\"color:#bdc3c7\">(he/she)</span><br /> <b>Onyx Path Community Manager<br /> Trinity Continuum Content Lead</b>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4-ianwatson","name":"IanWatson","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4_2.png","title":"Community Manager","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1512"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-04-22T12:40:05-07:00","id":1445315,"title":"","content":"So what I\u2019m hearing is we should expect Azoth, a setting covering late 17th and early 18th century swashbuckling Talents and Inspired Alchemy, before Aegis then?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Check out my expansion to the <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/185084-autochthonia-house-material\" target=\"_blank\">Realm of Brass and Shadow</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1098-glamourweaver","name":"glamourweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1098_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"7541"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-04-22T12:59:26-07:00","id":1445320,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>glamourweaver</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/1441517-trinity-continuum-max-mercer-theory?p=1445315#post1445315\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">So what I\u2019m hearing is we should expect Azoth, a setting covering late 17th and early 18th century swashbuckling Talents and Inspired Alchemy, before Aegis then?</div> </div> </div> </div>The Esoteric Order of the Aeons is big hint in that direction...","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481584/house-rules-bundle-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">House Rules - The Bundle</a> - House Rules for Everyone<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481581/powered-inspiration-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">Powered Inspired</a> - Powered Characters using Inspiration and Gifts<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/413362/Fists-and-Tomes-BUNDLE\" target=\"_blank\">Fists and Tomes</a> - Inspired Martial Arts and Mysticism for Talents<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/492147/supertech\" target=\"_blank\">Supertech</a> - Super Science in the hands of Talents","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24985-mateus-luz","name":"Mateus Luz","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24985_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2950"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-04-22T15:01:11-07:00","id":1445346,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Mateus Luz</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/1441517-trinity-continuum-max-mercer-theory?p=1445320#post1445320\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> The Esoteric Order of the Aeons is big hint in that direction...</div> </div> </div> </div>I was joking, but good point.<br /> <br /> (or it could just be an occult secret society for a Victorian setting)","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Check out my expansion to the <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/185084-autochthonia-house-material\" target=\"_blank\">Realm of Brass and Shadow</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1098-glamourweaver","name":"glamourweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1098_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"7541"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-04-22T16:47:56-07:00","id":1445375,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>glamourweaver</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/1441517-trinity-continuum-max-mercer-theory?p=1445346#post1445346\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> I was joking, but good point.<br /> <br /> (or it could just be an occult secret society for a Victorian setting)</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> Or there could be some boot strap paradoxing involved. There do seem to be some suggestions Mercer traveled back in time as much as forward...","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2715-lian","name":"Lian","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5218"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-04-22T18:58:42-07:00","id":1445391,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>impernious</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/1441517-trinity-continuum-max-mercer-theory?p=1445062#post1445062\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Michael is still experiencing spurned love. But instead of the (honestly rather unbelievable) trope of a gay man holding onto feelings for a straight man, it is that feeling when a person admits they love you but still refuse to date you because &amp;quot;it's me, not you&amp;quot;. A far more relatable scenario, and one that can and has driven people to terrible ends.</div> </div> </div> </div>I totally Liked this post.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"","name":"Guest","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/default/default_avatar_large.png","title":"","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-04-24T15:45:14-07:00","id":1445724,"title":"","content":"I have to say that I feel terrible for Max. I mean, just think about his position. For all his power he has basically been reduced to be his timeline's janitor, quietly cleaning up messes and doing little things to try and improve it, but not change it in any significant way, at least not without risking creating another timeline (and possible another evil Max). Then to make matters worse he's been hunted by a future version of himself that became his opposite, and he's much more powerful, talking about a blow to your moral (he could be staring at his future for all we know). Finally, he's completely alone with no one he can trust or ask for help, or just talk. So knowing all this, how does he do it? How does he retain any hope whatsoever? Has he seen a future where perhaps, just perhaps, everything turns alright? I hope that the supplement of timelines gives us more information.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2964-firanai","name":"Firanai","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2964_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"672"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-04-24T17:39:31-07:00","id":1445751,"title":"","content":"I don't get why he has to be alone though. I mean he has at least one if not two other really super-powerful individuals he could talk to about what he saw. Imagine the conversations that Max, Michael, and Sara could all have. Honest, forthright, direct conversations about the multiverse and timelines and all that. <br /> <br /> Instead all three people decide to keep their secrets. Thus causing problems. <br /> <br /> I want there to be a potential timeline where the three sit down and talk. Where problems are hashed out and friendships go stronger and the Aeon Society becomes say the Aeon Alliance or the Aeon Deliberate and humanity reaches a golden age in a golden city and such. <br /> <br /> Of course, to make things interesting, said Golden City is being targeted the another timeline, one of shadows and darkness and evil beyond telling. <br /> <br /> Maybe said Aeon Deliberate of the Golden City works to hire agents throughout the multiverse in order to bring about more golden futures. That would be cool.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/661-lordheru","name":"LordHeru","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar661_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1100"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-04-24T18:14:44-07:00","id":1445757,"title":"","content":"I was enjoying the idea of mutual destruction of the 3 as the \u201cbest option\u201d but your idea is better.<br /> <br /> Yes, the 3 are to egoistic and self centered to build something as a group. Well, Michael helped Max to build his little society and helped Sara to leave the country that would hunt her down, but it didn\u2019t ended well.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481584/house-rules-bundle-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">House Rules - The Bundle</a> - House Rules for Everyone<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481581/powered-inspiration-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">Powered Inspired</a> - Powered Characters using Inspiration and Gifts<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/413362/Fists-and-Tomes-BUNDLE\" target=\"_blank\">Fists and Tomes</a> - Inspired Martial Arts and Mysticism for Talents<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/492147/supertech\" target=\"_blank\">Supertech</a> - Super Science in the hands of Talents","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24985-mateus-luz","name":"Mateus Luz","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24985_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2950"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-04-25T02:27:14-07:00","id":1445796,"title":"","content":"He's alone because he can't, or won't, reveal everything to Sara and Michael. If I understand the rules of time travel correctly, being frank with them could work, but it would just create another timeline. Telling them won't make any difference at all (or maybe it does, maybe there's a timeline where he tried)<br /> <br /> Besides, the main problem I see with the 3 is as you all have mentioned: They're three very smart, and proud, people who are convinced they are right, and because they are convinced they are right they keep secrets from the other only two people in the world who could understand them, which slowly but inevitably erodes the trust between them.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2964-firanai","name":"Firanai","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2964_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"672"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-04-25T06:57:07-07:00","id":1445815,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Firanai</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/1441517-trinity-continuum-max-mercer-theory?p=1445796#post1445796\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">He's alone because he can't, or won't, reveal everything to Sara and Michael. If I understand the rules of time travel correctly, being frank with them could work, but it would just create another timeline. Telling them won't make any difference at all (or maybe it does, maybe there's a timeline where he tried)<br /> <br /> Besides, the main problem I see with the 3 is as you all have mentioned: They're three very smart, and proud, people who are convinced they are right, and because they are convinced they are right they keep secrets from the other only two people in the world who could understand them, which slowly but inevitably erodes the trust between them.</div> </div> </div> </div>It is my assumption that Max has tried being forthcoming with Michael and Sara. And every attempt caused chaos.<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"color:#181818\"><span style=\"font-family:Merriweather\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">\u201cHumpty had always sat on walls, it was his way.\u201d </span></span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#181818\"><span style=\"font-family:Merriweather\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">\u2015 </span></span></span><span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"font-family:Lato\"><b><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Jasper Fforde, </span></b></span></span><span style=\"color:#181818\"><span style=\"font-family:Merriweather\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://www.goodreads.com/work/quotes/2504943\" target=\"_blank\">The Big Over Easy</a></span></span></span>","edited":{"userid":1756,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1756-mythadvocate","user":"MythAdvocate","date":". 04-25-2021, 10:17 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1756-mythadvocate","name":"MythAdvocate","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1756_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"444"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-04-25T08:13:48-07:00","id":1445821,"title":"","content":"See I much prefer a lighter, hopeful element to things. I don't want all conversation to be failure. I want there to be a positive thing that leads to good. <br /> <br /> Maybe its like the Doctor Strange and the ten million potential futures with but one that leads to success - in a thousand conversations things go bad, but there are some that lead to success. Let us be that one that leads to success. <br /> <br /> The path to get to that success can be fraught with trouble and danger, but even more it is fraught with Adventure!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/661-lordheru","name":"LordHeru","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar661_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1100"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-04-25T08:36:38-07:00","id":1445825,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>LordHeru</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/1441517-trinity-continuum-max-mercer-theory?p=1445821#post1445821\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">See I much prefer a lighter, hopeful element to things. I don't want all conversation to be failure. I want there to be a positive thing that leads to good.<br /> <br /> Maybe its like the Doctor Strange and the ten million potential futures with but one that leads to success - in a thousand conversations things go bad, but there are some that lead to success. Let us be that one that leads to success.<br /> <br /> The path to get to that success can be fraught with trouble and danger, but even more it is fraught with Adventure!</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> Sounds like that conversation is one that Max is trying to find.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"color:#181818\"><span style=\"font-family:Merriweather\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">\u201cHumpty had always sat on walls, it was his way.\u201d </span></span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#181818\"><span style=\"font-family:Merriweather\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">\u2015 </span></span></span><span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"font-family:Lato\"><b><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Jasper Fforde, </span></b></span></span><span style=\"color:#181818\"><span style=\"font-family:Merriweather\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://www.goodreads.com/work/quotes/2504943\" target=\"_blank\">The Big Over Easy</a></span></span></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1756-mythadvocate","name":"MythAdvocate","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1756_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"444"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-04-25T09:56:18-07:00","id":1445839,"title":"","content":"The problem there is, once you talk, time travel like Max do would not change it, because the one talking is the past self and not the one that knows the results. Unless you come back and talk to yourself past self, but than you can\u2019t undo it too.<br /> <br /> We get to that scene where a infinite number of copies show up in the time it\u2019s about to happen to change the character mind. That\u2019s the kind of limitation Max time travel have over the Butterfly Effect / Days of Future Past (movie) way.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481584/house-rules-bundle-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">House Rules - The Bundle</a> - House Rules for Everyone<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481581/powered-inspiration-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">Powered Inspired</a> - Powered Characters using Inspiration and Gifts<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/413362/Fists-and-Tomes-BUNDLE\" target=\"_blank\">Fists and Tomes</a> - Inspired Martial Arts and Mysticism for Talents<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/492147/supertech\" target=\"_blank\">Supertech</a> - Super Science in the hands of Talents","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24985-mateus-luz","name":"Mateus Luz","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24985_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2950"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-04-25T10:16:55-07:00","id":1445842,"title":"","content":"Time travel is such a doozy. lol <br /> <br /> So, from what we know, small changes can adjust the timeline while big changes lead to a fork to a different timeline. I would think a million little changes could lead to a major shift in the actual timeline, but that would require lots of micromanagement and such. This leads me to wondering if Max shouldn't create a temporal version of Aeon, maybe have their be some sort of super-item using telluric energies to let one manipulate the time stream in interesting ways. <br /> <br /> In this I have to say I am glad that time travel powers are at this time not something anyone can do. Right now, canon wise, all we have is one person who can shift his time from present to past to future and comes in, makes a comment, stays a while, then leaves. If lots of people do it then we need to have mechanics for it - and that is a book and a half itself. <br /> <br /> So much potential here though, so much fun potential.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/661-lordheru","name":"LordHeru","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar661_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1100"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-06-08T01:01:13-07:00","id":1451288,"title":"","content":"In today's <a href=\"http://theonyxpath.com/the-road-of-exess-monday-meeting-notes/\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Monday Meeting Notes</b></a> we have more of Max Mercer - Micheal Donighal ( a.k.a. Dr. Primoris, a.k.a Davis Mal ) relation comics in Aberrant era <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/cool.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Cool\" smilieid=\"6\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getEleme